obile and desktop.\n13. Add realistic demo data so judges can immediately see the AI analysis.\n14. Add loading, success, and error states.\n15. Do not expose API keys in frontend code.\n\nAfter implementation:\n\n- run the project\n- fix all build/runtime errors\n- verify all existing features still work\n- verify the new AI Risk Assessment feature works\n- give me a short summary of files changed and how to test the feature."],"01a01845-f9fc-7d32-af62-0ec5f27b2ca6":["how to run this code in vs code","this error is showing","iske badh kya kre","\nPhase 2 goal:\nAdd a visible AI-powered intelligence layer to the existing travel safety solution.\n\nImplement an AI Risk Assessment feature.\n\nRequirements:\n1. Add an \"AI Risk Assessment\" section to the existing UI.\n2. Take available trip data such as:\n   - current location\n   - destination\n   - expected route\n   - route deviation\n   - time of travel\n   - user-reported incident\n   - optional community reports\n3. Analyze these signals and calculate a risk level:\n   LOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH.\n4. Show:\n   - Risk level\n   - Risk score\n   - Main reasons for the risk\n   - Recommended action\n5. If risk is HIGH, clearly show \"Priority Alert Recommended\".\n6. Detect unusual route deviation and treat significant unexpected deviation as a risk signal.\n7. Add contextual reasoning instead of only showing a fixed rule-based result.\n8. If an actual AI/API integration is already available in the project, use it.\n9. If no AI API is configured, create a clean AI-service abstraction/mock implementation so the feature works during the hackathon demo, and clearly structure it so a real AI API can be connected later.\n10. Do not break any existing Phase 1 functionality.\n11. Keep the existing design and improve it professionally.\n12. Make the feature responsive for mobile and desktop.\n13. Add realistic demo data so judges can immediately see the AI analysis.\n14. Add loading, success, and error states.\n15. Do not expose API keys in frontend code.\n\nAfter implementation:\n- run the project\n- fix all build/runtime errors\n- verify all existing features still work\n- verify the new AI Risk Assessment feature works\n- give me a short summary of files changed and how to test the feature."]},"thread-reference-capability:01a01845-f9fc-7d32-af62-0ec5f27b2ca6":true,"thread-client-id-v1:local%3A01a01845-f9fc-7d32-af62-0ec5f27b2ca6":"client-new-thread:fabeb039-e2a4-47af-9a98-b50568f367cd","client-thread-bindings-v1":{"client-new-thread:fabeb039-e2a4-47af-9a98-b50568f367cd":"01a01845-f9fc-7d32-af62-0ec5f27b2ca6","client-new-thread:a7cf7716-340f-4366-8ba4-e5379e93061a":"01a01883-d47a-7671-a853-8d147f29b5cf"},"heartbeat-thread-permissions-by-id":{"01a01845-f9fc-7d32-af62-0ec5f27b2ca6":{"activePermissionProfile":{"id":":workspace","extends":null},"approvalPolicy":{"granular":{"sandbox_approval":false,"rules":false,"skill_approval":false,"request_permissions":true,"mcp_elicitations":true}},"approvalsReviewer":"user","sandboxPolicy":{"type":"workspaceWrite","writableRoots":["C:\\Users\\hp\\Documents\\Codex","C:\\Users\\hp\\.codex\\visualizations\\2026\\08\\19\\01a01845-f9fc-7d32-af62-0ec5f27b2ca6"],"networkAccess":false,"excludeTmpdirEnvVar":false,"excludeSlashTmp":false}},"01a0185d-30db-7450-9342-4ffc0c68b8cd":{"activePermissionProfile":{"id":":read-only","extends":null},"approvalPolicy":"on-request","approvalsReviewer":"user","sandboxPolicy":{"type":"readOnly","networkAccess":false}},"01a0185d-4778-7922-a384-817794e65e6d":{"activePermissionProfile":{"id":":read-only","extends":null},"approvalPolicy":"on-request","approvalsReviewer":"user","sandboxPolicy":{"type":"readOnly","networkAccess":false}},"01a01883-d47a-7671-a853-8d147f29b5cf":{"activePermissionProfile":{"id":":workspace","extends":null},"approvalPolicy":{"granular":{"sandbox_approval":false,"rules":false,"skill_approval":false,"request_permissions":true,"mcp_elicitations":true}},"approvalsReviewer":"user","sandboxPolicy":{"type":"work